__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/

# A19 bug bash: secrets should only ever come from the environment, never
# a committed file. GROQ_API_KEY and friends belong in a local .env that
# must never be tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.db

# A19 bug bash: AliasStore's cache (A9) persists to disk by design (a 2nd
# run should make zero LLM calls), but that means it's local dev-instance
# state, never something to commit -- found while bug-bashing when a
# stray copy from a manual test run could silently change a later,
# unrelated pytest run's outcome.
alias_cache.json
